  "reasoning": "The defendants (the company and its legal representative) used a government official's position to obtain a recommendation letter, allowing a company without proper qualifications to illegally extract oil. They also paid the official 200,000 yuan as a bribe. This constitutes the crime of bribery (行贿) for the parties giving the bribe, and the illegal oil extraction falls under the crime of illegal mining (非法采矿).",
